# UX Regression Checklist

After overlay/template capture/modal/dock changes verify on Windows:
- Confirm dialog near cursor (`card_popup_shell`, `center_card_popup`)
- Cursor visible during region pick (no `ShowCursor(FALSE)` loops)
- Saved template PNG clean (freeze frame before host restore)
- Teardown order: overlay close → capture callback → restore host → modal
